        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kala Qaybintii Dhulka Xagga Galbeedka Ee Webi Urdun",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanu waa dhaxalkii ay reer binu Israa'iil ka qaateen dalkii reer Kancaan, oo wadaadkii Elecaasaar ahaa, iyo Yashuuca ina Nuun, iyo madaxdii qabiilooyinkii reer binu Israa'iil ay u qaybiyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidii Rabbigu ku amray Muuse sagaal qabiil iyo qabiil badhkiis saami bay ku heleen dhaxalkoodii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Muuse wuxuu laba qabiil iyo qabiil badhkiis dhaxal ka siiyey Webi Urdun shishadiisa: laakiinse reer Laawi innaba dhaxal ma uu siin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maxaa yeelay, reer Yuusuf waxay ahaayeen laba qabiil, oo kala ah reer Manaseh iyo reer Efrayim; oo dhulkii qayb lagama siin reer Laawi magaalooyinkii ay degganaayeen mooyaane, iyo agagaarkoodii ay xoolahoodii iyo alaabtoodii ku hayn jireen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidii Rabbigu Muuse ku amray ayay reer binu Israa'iil yeeleen, oo dalkiina way qaybsadeen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Xebroon Oo La Siiyey Kaaleeb",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa reer Yahuudah waxay u soo dhowaadeen Yashuuca oo Gilgaal joogay; oo Kaaleeb ina Yefunneh, oo ahaa reer Qenes, wuxuu isagii ku yidhi, Waad garanaysaa wixii aniga iyo adiga inagu saabsanaa oo Rabbigu u sheegay Muuse oo ahaa nin Ilaah, markaynu Qaadeesh Barneeca joognay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afartan sannadood baan jiray markii addoonkii Ilaah oo Muuse ahaa iga diray Qaadeesh Barneeca inaan dalka soo basaaso; oo sidii qalbigayga ku jirtay ayaan ugu soo war celiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habase yeeshee walaalahaygii i raacay ayaa dadka qalbi dhalaaliyey, laakiinse anigu daacad baan u raacay Rabbiga Ilaahayga ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalintaas ayuu Muuse dhaartay, oo yidhi, Hubaal dhulkii cagtaadu ku joogsatay wuxuu dhaxal u ahaan doonaa adiga iyo carruurtaada weligiin, maxaa yeelay, daacad baad u raacday Rabbiga Ilaahayga ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddaba bal eeg, Rabbigu waa i soo gaadhsiiyey ilaa haatan, anoo nool, siduu ku hadlay, oo shan iyo afartankan sannadood baa ka dambaysay markii Rabbigu Muuse eraygan kula hadlay, oo waxay ahayd intii ay reer binu Israa'iil cidlada dhex socdeen; oo haatanna maanta waxaan jiraa shan iyo siddeetan sannadood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba maanta iyo maalintii Muuse i diray isku xoog baan ahay; oo intii itaalkaygu waagaas ahaa ayuu haatanna yahay inaan dagaal galo, iyo inaan baxo, soona galo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba sidaas daraaddeed i sii buurtan Rabbigu maalintaas ka hadlay, waayo, waad maqashay maalintaas in reer Canaaq halkaas joogay, oo ay magaalooyinkoodu waaweynaayeen, deyrarna lahaayeen. Mindhaa Rabbigaa ila jiri doona, waanan eryi doonaa sidii Rabbigu ku hadlay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yashuuca u dhuceeyey isagii, oo Kaaleeb ina Yefunneh dhaxal u siiyey Xebroon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed ilaa maantadan la joogo Xebroon waxay dhaxal u noqotay Kaaleeb ina Yefunneh oo ahaa reer Qenes, maxaa yeelay, daacad buu u raacay Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waagii hore Xebroon magaceeda waxaa la odhan jiray Qiryad Arbac; oo Arbacna wuxuu ahaa ninkii ugu weynaa reer Canaaq. Oo dalkiina dagaal wuu ka xasillay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
